      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "\"It's the Negroes, plain and simple. They're stirring up trouble where they don't belong, and it's gonna spoil the whole town's good name.\" \"They think they can just walk in here and change the order things have always been? They don't know their place, not one bit.\" \"If they start mixing in the lunch line, my business is done for. This town runs a certain way, and they ain't fit to run it.\"",
      "source": "target",
